    S5["Root Cause Analysis: data pipeline, macro effects, feature drift"]:::step
    S6["Retraining Decision Governance Board"]:::step
    S7["Version Increment & Change Log"]:::step
    E((To Explainability & Reporting))

    A --> S0 --> S1 --> S2 --> S3 --> S4 --> D1
